  "content": "<div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fYzEsIq.png\" alt=\"Ametrin API Banner\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/gMpXyeYJMg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/837670782753832991.svg?color=7289DA&label=discord&logo=discord&logoColor=FFFFFF&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Ametrin Studios Discord Server\"></a> – <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/block-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-Block Variants-d7742f?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Used in Block Variants\"></a> – <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-witcher-content\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-The Witcher-7289DA?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Used in The Witcher\"></a> – <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fneoforged.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modloader-NeoForge-d7742f?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Built with NeoForge\"></a></div>\n<p><br></p>\n<h1>Ametrin Studios 提供的 QoL API</h1>\n<h4>當前功能</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>大量數據生成輔助工具</li>\n<li>方塊類（雙層植物、可生長灌木、可生長雙層植物、頭部、火把等）</li>\n<li>創建類似下界傳送門</li>\n<li>創建樹木和树苗</li>\n<li>結構組件</li>\n<li>地形分析器（被 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dungeonsenhanced\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dungeons Enhanced</a> 使用）</li>\n<li>時間轉換</li>\n<li>顏色轉換</li>\n<li>添加可剝皮的圓木</li>\n<li>更多功能</li>\n</ul>\n<p>如果您希望在自己的項目中使用 Ametrin API，請查看 GitHub 倉庫。<br>\n您可以在我們的 Discord 服務器上提問。</p>",
